tor 3** | 22.431s | 22.104s | +0.327s | **LANDO NORRIS FASTER** | Top Speed +5.0 km/h (304 vs 304 km/h) & 59% full throttle |\\n| **Top Speed ($V_{max}$)** | 300 km/h | 308 km/h | -8 km/h | **Lando Norris** | Peak straight-line aerodynamic efficiency |\\n| **Full Throttle %** | 47.2% | 50.3% | -3.1% | **Lando Norris** | Total lap commitment at 100% accelerator pedal |\\n\\n**Sector-by-Sector Breakdown:**\\n- Sector 1: Lando Norris was quicker by 0.654s (24.876s vs 25.530s). Lando Norris reached higher top speed (308.0 km/h vs 300.0 km/h) with 58.8% full throttle duration (vs 47.1% for Max Verstappen), maximizing top-end power.\\n- Sector 2: Max Verstappen was quicker by 0.046s (26.791s vs 26.837s). Max Verstappen carried greater apex minimum speed (118.0 km/h vs 104.0 km/h) through corner apexes and committed earlier to full power (33.3% full throttle).\\n- Sector 3: Lando Norris was quicker by 0.327s (22.104s vs 22.431s). Lando Norris reached higher top speed (304.0 km/h vs 299.0 km/h) with 58.8% full throttle duration (vs 61.1% for Max Verstappen), maximizing top-end power.\\n\\nPerformance Summary: Max Verstappen was the stronger performer in Sector 2, whereas Lando Norris held the advantage in Sector 1, Sector 3.", "tyre_degradation": [{"lap": 1, "note": "START-LAP", "stint": 1, "status": "start_lap", "compound": "MEDIUM", "wear_pct": null, "pace_loss_s": null}, {"lap": 2, "stint": 1, "compound": "MEDIUM", "wear_pct": 0, "pace_loss_s": 0}, {"lap": 3, "stint": 1, "compound": "MEDIUM", "wear_pct": 3.7, "pace_loss_s": 0.092}, {"lap": 4, "stint": 1, "compound": "MEDIUM", "wear_pct": 6.7, "pace_loss_s": 0.168}, {"lap": 5, "stint": 1, "compound": "MEDIUM", "wear_pct": 9.6, "pace_loss_s": 0.24}, {"lap": 6, "stint": 1, "compound": "MEDIUM", "wear_pct": 11.8, "pace_loss_s": 0.294}, {"lap": 7, "stint": 1, "compound": "MEDIUM", "wear_pct": 15.2, "pace_loss_s": 0.38}, {"lap": 8, "stint": 1, "compound": "MEDIUM", "wear_pct": 18.4, "pace_loss_s": 0.459}, {"lap": 9, "stint": 1