rand Prix (Lap 53: 81.432s vs 81.745s for Max Verstappen on Lap 43), holding a total lap time advantage of 0.313s.\\n\\n| Metric / Sector | Max Verstappen (Lap 43) | Lando Norris (Lap 53) | Delta | Advantage | Key Telemetry Factor |\\n| :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: | :--- |\\n| **Total Lap Time** | **81.745s** | **81.432s** | **+0.313s** | **Lando Norris** | **Fastest valid session lap pace** |\\n| **Sector 1** | 26.877s | 27.136s | -0.259s | **MAX VERSTAPPEN FASTER** | Apex Speed +8.0 km/h (79 vs 71 km/h) |\\n| **Sector 2** | 27.614s | 27.492s | +0.122s | **LANDO NORRIS FASTER** | Top Speed +7.0 km/h (329 vs 329 km/h) & 53% full throttle |\\n| **Sector 3** | 27.254s | 26.804s | +0.450s | **LANDO NORRIS FASTER** | Top Speed +9.0 km/h (330 vs 330 km/h) & 71% full throttle |\\n| **Top Speed ($V_{max}$)** | 332 km/h | 338 km/h | -6 km/h | **Lando Norris** | Peak straight-line aerodynamic efficiency |\\n| **Full Throttle %** | 68.1% | 64.6% | +3.5% | **Max Verstappen** | Total lap commitment at 100% accelerator pedal |\\n\\n**Sector-by-Sector Breakdown:**\\n- Sector 1: Max Verstappen was quicker by 0.259s (26.877s vs 27.136s). Max Verstappen carried greater apex minimum speed (79.0 km/h vs 71.0 km/h) through corner apexes and committed earlier to full power (72.2% full throttle).\\n- Sector 2: Lando Norris was quicker by 0.122s (27.492s vs 27.614s). Lando Norris reached higher top speed (329.0 km/h vs 322.0 km/h) with 52.6% full throttle duration (vs 55.6% for Max Verstappen), maximizing top-end power.\\n- Sector 3: Lando Norris was quicker by 0.450s (26.804s vs 27.254s). Lando Norris reached higher top speed (330.0 km/h vs 321.0 km/h) with 70.6% full throttle duration (vs 76.5% for Max Verstappen), maximizing top-end power.\\n\\nPerformance Summary: Max Verstappen was the stronger performer in Sector 1, whereas Lando Norris held the advantage in Sector 2, Sector 3.", "tyre_degradation": [{"lap": 1, "note": "START-LAP", "stint": 1, "status": "start_lap", "compou